window.products.push({"id":1054176,"name":"18\" Stainless Steel Durable, Non-Stick French Rolling Pin Combo Kit. For Baking Dough, Pizza, Pastry, Pasta, Pie/Cookies. Comes with: Thickness Rings,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QWxWrhduL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rolling pins are commonly used to form pastry, but unlike other rolling pins, this one is adjustable, allowing you to shape your dough into any size you desire. It is also rust-proof and easy to clean because it is made of stainless steel. This device is ideal for people who enjoy cooking and baking because it helps them to roll their way through the process with ease and precision. PREMIUM QUALITY MATERIALS - Our French Rolling Pin is made of 100% stainless steel. The Rolling pin is 18\" offering a longer surface to knead dough than classic rolling pin. Easy Handling, directly control movement of the pin and apply your desired amount of pressure directly onto dough. ADJUSTABLE THICKNESS RINGS - This set comes with 4 thickness rings that are 2mm, 5mm, 7mm, 10mm. Perfect for both beginners and seasoned chefs. The thickness rings make it easier for you to roll your way through with ease and precision. EASY TO CLEAN - With a smoother and seamless surface, spend less time cleaning and maintaining a wooden roller and more time baking mouth watering treats! Simply rinse clean after use or wipe with a damp cloth. Hand drying recommended. PERFECT GIFT - This product is perfect for beginners or seasoned chefs. You can gift it to any relative, family or friends who wants to cook their own fondant, cookie or pizza dough. This is a perfect gift for any occasion such as Christmas, wedding, Thanksgiving, Valentines and many more. There is a typo on the box, the rolling pin is actually 18\" not 16\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QWxWrhduL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merkaba Utensils","source_asin":"B08Y9BCCHP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y9BCCHP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y9BCCHP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
