window.products.push({"id":1054263,"name":"3 in 1 Wrap Dispenser Organizer (3 ROLL FOIL, PAPER, PLASTIC), Kitchen Wrap Organizer Extra Wide 13.5\" Foil Cutter. Aluminum Foil Wax Paper Wrap Dispe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GYyo3+5YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fits Your Larger Rolls, Too! There’s no way you can cram a 13.25” roll into a regular wrap dispenser. So instead, we made this kitchen wrap organizer 16” wide with a 13.5” slide cutter! Now you can truly tidy up by storing all your 12” rolls and all the longer ones! Do You Need Two Rolls, or Three? This paper food wrap and aluminum foil holder is a 2 in 1 wrap dispenser with cutter. The inside space is 14.5” across and fits two 2.25” thick rolls. If you need less storage out of your wrap organizer with cutter, we also have 2-in-1 bamboo storage, too! Easy On The Eye and Easier To Use: You already know how beautiful Bamboo is to your kitchen and the planet, but this is 100% premium Moso Bamboo – durable and holds its shape. We also made the front opening a generous 6” so you can grab the end of your wrap without losing a piece of your hand. A Cutter That Actually Cuts! Our super smooth and sharp slider cuts through tin foil and wax paper without bunching. But that’s not the only easy thing. Our sliding front cover makes loading rolls super-fast and easy, while the no-fade lettering won’t peel off. No need for loose sticker sheets! For Drawer OR Wall! This food wrap dispenser with cutter is 16” x 8.5” x 3.5\" (with 0.1” silicone pads not included). Please ensure you drawer can clear a 3.5 inch height. It also features 2 holes for hanging! So measure up your drawer or wall, and order with confidence. Satisfaction Guaranteed: If anything weird happens just contact us ASAP and we’ll help, fast! Try it now and let's say bye to clutter and get organized!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GYyo3+5YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parkway Home","source_asin":"B0B93LZXFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B93LZXFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B93LZXFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
