window.products.push({"id":1054359,"name":"WHITEWRAP Cotton Bread Bag | Natural Organic Reusable bread bag for homemade bread gift | Bread Container Sourdough Loaf | Counter Top Cloth Bread Sto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FljI8t21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKING HOMEMADE BREAD: Our unique reusable bread bag is great for your homemade bread. Simple to use and easy to clean. Our linen bread loaf bags can be washed by hand or machine and dried out of direct sunlight. No drawstring just fold and clip to lock in the freshness. BREAD STORAGE LARGE: let the dough rise to its fullest, bake it in the oven or bread maker and let it cool. No need to worry about you bread not fitting in one of our amply sized reusable bread bags. Unlike other cloth bread bag our bread container is 17” X 12”, and can easily store any of your large loafs ready for lunch. THE IDEAL GIFT GIVING: Organic linen Bread Bags are great gifts for your friends and family. Gift for Mom, Birthday Gift for Wife, Bread Saver Bags help provide a Zero Waste Bread Storage option for your bread from the bakery or for your Homemade Bread. Not only does it make the perfect present for your environment conscious friends, but it also makes an ideal housewarming gift for those who love to bake. They are far better than single use plastic bread bags. ECO-FRIENDLY REUSABLE PREMIUM COTTON BREAD BAGS: At WHITEWRAP, making the world a cleaner place is what we’re all about. Help make a difference by buying our large cotton reusable bread bag. No need for buying paper bread bags or plastic bags for your bread storage and transport then disposing of them. They are vegan-friendly, BPA free, sustainable and an eco-friendly natural choice. - 100% Recyclable and Sustainable - Zero Waste. OUR PROMISE TO YOU: Known For Eco-friendly And Sustainable Bags.If You Are Not Happy With Any Purchase, We Will Gladly Send You A Replacement Or Provide A Full Refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FljI8t21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHITEWRAP","source_asin":"B08XKLQ94V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XKLQ94V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XKLQ94V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1054360,"name":"Mini Handheld Fan, Portable Fan for Kids with Soft Blade, Safety Powerful Small Fan, Low Noise Personal Fan, Cute Kids Fan, Battery Powered Rechargeab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O59o8oMAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐻【Powerful Pocket Fan】: Small but not affect strong airflow. Fan cover will block the wind and let the fan heavier. Designed without a cover, the fan's airflow is stronger, cooling you down in 3 seconds. Upgraded motor makes the top speed up to 13.1ft/s, easily relieve hot flashes. 🐻【Soft Blade & Safety Function】: TPE material is soft and safe, when the blades hit your fingers, it will not hurt you. Also, the portable fan has a built-in sensitive touch sensor, the blades automatically stop when touched. Let you have no worries when using it. 🐻【Large Battery Capacity】: Rechargeable fan has a built-in 2600mAh battery, provides 12-16 hours cooling time, a USB-C cable included, compatible with all USB output devices. The mini fan have two speeds wind, which can also beat heat perfectly, enough for personal use to keep you cool. 🐻【 Compact & Lightweight】: Only 4.8 Ounce, the personal fan can retracts to hide the blades, small enough to fit in almost any pocket and bag. Also, with a included lanyard, you can hang it around your neck, hands or travel backpack. Take a small fan and enjoy the coolness in summer without any burden. 🐻【Low Noise】: The travel fan with brushless motor creates lower noise and have a longer lifetime, with only 35-45dB of noise in operation. Packing List: Handheld fan x 1, Charging cable x 1, User manual x 1, Lanyard x 1. 🐻【Summer Gift】: The mini fan portable is smaller than a phone, which is the best choice for outdoor activities, such as travel, hiking, camping, shopping. Also can be a desk fan, eyelash fan. The cooling fan is cute, powerful and useful, a great gift for your family and friends in summer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O59o8oMAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kkdi","source_asin":"B0C2VNTLM7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2VNTLM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2VNTLM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
