window.products.push({"id":1054362,"name":"Oslimea Outdoor Window Air Conditioner Cover Window AC Cover with Adjustable Straps Bottom Covered (25.5\" W x 17\" H x 21\" D)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qnmyy54sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Oslimea durable, protective cover fits snugly over the back of AC window units to prevent dust, dirt, and cold, winter air from entering the home! 4 Sizes Available: There are total 4 sizes for your option to fit any brand and most standard-sized window AC units. 17\" W x 13\" H x 12\" D 21.5\" W x 15\" H x 16\" D 25.5\" W x 17\" H x 21\" D 27.5\" W x 19\" H x 25\" D  High density& Waterproof Material and Energy Saving: All our outdoor covers are made of 600D high-quality polyester, and we offer 3-year quality guaranty. Resistant to water, rain, snow and sharply reducing heating cost during winter, which is allowing long term outdoor service.  Easy to Install: No installation tools required. Simply put the cover over the outside of air conditioner. There are two adjustable straps with snap buckle to fix the cover, easy to put on and take off, avoiding the cover to drop. Great Convenience: No need to dismount your A/C unit each winter. This outdoor cover allows you to leave your AC unit in the window all year long. All our covers are machine washable & reusable& durable. High Health &Sanitation: Preventing dust, dirt, and other small debris from blocking your A/C unit when not in use and keeping you and your family in perfect health. Adjustable Buckles Straps: Secure with two adjustable straps for a tight and custom fit and protect the outside cover during windy conditions. Features: Cover all the outside Air Conditioner Units(bottom included). Reduce heating costs, prolong A/C life. Easy assembly, durable, and convenient. Keep debris and other unwanted items out. Blocks cold air drafts from entering your home. 6000D polyester construction, resistant to sunlight, cold and Extreme temperature. Eliminate the need to remove A/C unit. Adjustable straps allows adjustment for a tight and custom fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qnmyy54sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oslimea","source_asin":"B07ZYY2RQL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZYY2RQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZYY2RQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
