window.products.push({"id":1054392,"name":"BIGCARJOB Custom Design Beer Can Coolers, Plain Bulk Collapsible Soda Cover Coolies, DIY Personalized Sublimation Sleeves for Weddings, Bachelorette,P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712EQH7qTYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Product Details: Material: polyester Product size:6.9H x 3.5D inches  Help Retain Drink Temperatures Safely Absorb Condensation Durable, Reusable, and Collapsible 6 different patterns of can covers Folds flat for easy storage and drying machine washing available DURABLE: Zig-Zag stitched side seams and bottom;  Function: perfect for birthday party,weeding party, football match, BBQ, family picnic, Bachelorette Party, Graduation Party etc GIFT IDEA: great gift for your beer loving friends or use them for party favor,picnic and beach etc. Note: Away from fire Package include:6 x can sleeves","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712EQH7qTYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIGCARJOB","source_asin":"B09HX528MB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HX528MB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HX528MB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1054393,"name":"Hardin HD-2344SS Stainless Steel Tabletop Melting Furnace with 4 Kilogram Crucible 110 Volt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":412.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vExHzOQvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Hardin HD-2344SS Stainless Steel Tabletop Melting Furnace with 4kg Crucible 110 Volt 1.5KW. Made with world leading 14 gauge Swedish Kenthal industrial heating elements. The best heating elements in the world! The thicker gauge makes them rugged and they last much longer than the 16 gauge so common in many furnaces on the market today. Our Hardin HD-2344SS 1.5KW 141 oz metallurgical smelting furnace is a compact electric furnace for melting scrap, reclaiming, alloying, and refining various metals. Perfect for pouring melted metals in casting operations when making bars or buttons. Works with high-karat gold, silver, copper, brass, and bronze. The electronic feature regulates the temperature by providing full power input to the coil until a selected temp is reached. Important to note, usually when you set temperatures, especially when first heating up the furnace, the actual read-out and temperature reached is going to be 50-100 degrees more than what you set the furnace to. That is perfectly normal. But eventually the temperature will come back down and stabilize and will hold to a +/- 5F. Setting the temp is easy. It requires you to \"set\" twice. Plug the unit in (fan comes on) and flip the on switch. Using the \"down\" button take the digital display's number to the temperature you want to set to. For example, gold melts at 1,948°F. So using the \"down\" button you set the temperature to 1,948°F. You then hit \"set\". A screen full of zeros will appear. The next step is to via a combination of \">\", \"down\", and \"up\" buttons set the numerical value to the same as before; in this case 1,948°F. Push \"set\" button. You have successfully set the temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vExHzOQvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hardin","source_asin":"B00A9WQO5O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A9WQO5O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A9WQO5O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
