window.products.push({"id":1054400,"name":"HIC Kitchen Spaetzle Noodle Dumpling Maker Lid with Scraper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41h2LWfVzyL._AC_.jpg","description":"HIC’s Spaetzle Maker Lid with Scraper easily makes dozens of perfectly formed dumplings in a single action. Whether just learning how to make dumplings or perfecting a spaetzle dumpling recipe, the Spaetzle Maker Lid fits up to 10.5-inch pots and easily forms the tender little dumplings in a consistent size to cook evenly. What is spaetzle? Spaetzle are softer egg noodles or dumplings originating from the traditional cuisines found in southern Germany and Austria, and very popular in Switzerland and Hungary. Spaetzle noodles are a hearty European egg dumpling, most commonly associated with German food, and can be served in place of pasta, much like chicken and dumplings, or instead of rice or potatoes alongside beef or veal, and added to soups and stews. Spaetzle is a true comfort food, enjoyed warm with applesauce or dressed in a simple spaetzle sauce made from butter, sugar, cinnamon or nutmeg. These tasty little German noodles are delicious with cheese, herbs, spices, or spinach and mixed with fresh cherries or apples, too. A great addition to cooking tools, HIC’s Spaetzle Maker Lid is so easy to use. Simply set the Spaetzle Lid over a boiling pot of broth or salted water and drag dough across the pierced surface with the scraper. Cook according to the dumpling recipe. Made from stainless steel with polypropylene scraper, HIC’s Spaetzle Maker Lid is sturdy, durable, and dishwasher safe for easy cleanup.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41h2LWfVzyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIC Kitchen","source_asin":"B086VPFCG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086VPFCG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086VPFCG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
