window.products.push({"id":1054412,"name":"Mini Bag Sealer, 2 in 1 Heat Seal and Cutter Mini Food Sealer, Mini Heat Vacuum Sealers With Hook for Plastic Bags Food Storage Snack Bag Battery Not ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y7w7DoWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Instructions for sealing machine 1. Heat will not be generated automatically after the battery is installed, but will not be generated until it is pressed down. 2. Install the battery according to the anode and cathode instructions at the bottom of the battery tank.If the battery is installed in the opposite direction, the sealing machine will not heat up. 3. After the battery is installed, keep pressing for about 3-5 seconds and start heating. 4. Put the bag to be sealed in the middle. The thinner bag can be pulled quickly, and the thicker bag can be pulled at a constant and slow speed. 5. After use, there is no need to remove the battery, just stick the hook in the seal. Note: Do not press violently when sealing, otherwise it will cause deformation of the metal contact sheet and no heat.The bags to be sealed must be kept clean and free from water, oil and other stains. When sealing, do not stay in one place too long, or you may burn a hole out","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y7w7DoWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DREAM HORSE","source_asin":"B08JTRJJS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JTRJJS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JTRJJS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
