window.products.push({"id":1054557,"name":"Black Clover Fabric Shower Curtain Set with 12 Hooks for Boys Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xV6Mf-63L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This shower curtain is made of high quality polyester fabric, which is waterproof, wrinkle free and quick dry. HD digital printing ensure that curtain keeps the graphic printed pattern for a long time. The folded edge design of the hem helps keep it in place and does not float into the bathroom, ensuring your good shower experience. Perfect decor for your bathroom, the distinctive anime pattern can add more joy during a bathing. Different colors and patterns of shower curtain are available, please buy with confidence, we wonincht disappoint you. Click and add to cart now. Specifications : Material : Polyester fabricAvailable Size : 72ʺ× 72ʺ 180cm × 180cmPattern : blackc 3 Package Included : One shower curtain with 12 plastic hooksWashing Tips : Hand wash or machine wash in the cold water. Hangs dry in a ventilated place. Prevent sharp things. Warm Tips : 1. It comes no liner because it can be used as a stand-alone curtain. 2. Due to the light brightness and computer display colors might be small difference. 3. Please kindly accept small difference in size due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xV6Mf-63L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PntBab","source_asin":"B08TTM4RZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TTM4RZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TTM4RZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1054558,"name":"Root Candles 20-Hour Scented Beeswax Blend Votive Candles, 18-Count, Mulled Cider","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BnE0AASVS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Root - the best candles in America, made in America. These votive candles are made with Root proprietary natural beeswax blend using pure Essential oil fragrances and an all-natural cotton wick. Root votives produce a long-lasting 20 hour burn with a rich sensory experience. Root 2-ounce votives are individually wrapped to protect their smooth satin finish and come in 42 luxurious fragrances and a wide variety of trending designer colors. Root candles is an iconic American company that traces its lineage back to 1869 when founder Amos Ives Root first opened his doors for business in Medina, Ohio. Since then, 5 generations of Root candle-makers have created the best candles in America. Using all-natural materials for purity and balance, Root candles seduce your senses, enhance your living space and soothe your soul. Candles are manufactured according to all ASTM (safety) standards. Root manufactures their own all-natural cotton wicks and test burns 1, 000 candles every day to check fragrance throw, emissions, soot, flame strength, stability, useful life, welling, dripping, and burn time. Stringent color matching is done daily to ensure consistent quality from batch to batch. Root has combined the time honored methods of early 20th century hand crafted candle-making, with 21st century automation technologies to continue a renowned tradition and reputation. Every Root candle is made in the USA, on the same plot of land Amos Ives Root, purchased over 100 years ago. The results are pure and simple: Root candles are highly regarded for complex bouquets of subtle fragrances and sophisticated color palettes. Today, Root candles continues traditional standards of superior candle craftsmanship while introducing vibrant new textures, brilliant new colors, complex and intriguing new fragrances, and innovative, modern designs to their collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BnE0AASVS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Root Candles","source_asin":"B075B2R97Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075B2R97Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075B2R97Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
