window.products.push({"id":1054640,"name":"Heated Blanket Electric Throw, LETIHIMD Soft Electric Blanket 50\"X60\" with 6 Heating Levels & 1-8H Auto Off, ETL&FCC Certification, Over-Heat Protect,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P8nviZy+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♨【6 Temperature Settings & 1-8 Hours Auto-Off】-The electric blanket’s temperature of each gear is 86℉,91℉,96℉,100℉, 104℉,107℉, you can choose the most suitable setting for your body temperature. It also has 1-8 Hours Auto-off, which is more safe for using and provide you with maximum safety protection, save electricity. There is no need to worry about forgetting to turn off after you fall asleep. ♨【Double-sided Soft Material & Extended Heating Wire】-The double-sided of the electric blanket is made of flannel and cotton velvet, which brings you the best softness and comfortability. The heating area of heating wire is 41.8in * 31in, which is denser and longer than the ordinary electric blanket heating wire. It can bring you continuous and stable high heat to promote blood circulation and relieve muscle pain and tension. ♨【Rapid Heating & Safety Protection】-Using PTC and NTC heating technology, the electric blanket can be heated in a few seconds, and the heating is more evenly; the protection system with dual certification of ETL and FCC prevents overheating and ensures that you and your family safe, eliminate potential safety hazards. ♨【Flexible & Wide Use】-The controller has a 9ft(nearly 2.78m) power cord, so that the electric blanket can work flexibly in a wider range without restriction. It can also be used as a regular blanket for everyday use with the controller unplugged, which is a best choice for Christmas gifts. ♨【Machine Washable & No Shedding】-After removing the temperature controller, you can wash it by hand or machine (below 30°C/86°F) to keep it hygienic, soft and durable. After multiple washings, the color will not fade or fall off. We offer a 2 year warranty, if there are any problems, please contact us promptly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P8nviZy+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LETIHIMD","source_asin":"B0BZPDHH4H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZPDHH4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZPDHH4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
