window.products.push({"id":1054755,"name":"Vari Essential Electric Standing Desk 48\" x 24\" (VariDesk) - Electric Height Adjustable Desk - Standing Desk for Office or Home - Sturdy Adjustable St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wm5i6tFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ESSENTIAL COLLECTION: By simplifying the design of our award-winning Electric Standing Desks, we're able to offer an affordable and quality-backed standing desk that's perfect for a home workstation. This rising desk model includes a solid one-piece tabletop with a durable laminate finish. Measuring 48\" x 24\", you have space for a computer monitor, laptop, notebook, and extra hardware. PROGRAMMABLE HEIGHT SETTINGS: Program up to 4 height settings to the LED control panel of your electric height adjustable desk, and transition to your perfect height with one touch. The powerful single motor and sturdy T-Style legs provide stability and smoothly lift the electric desk to any height from 27.5\" to 47.2\". ERGONOMIC ADJUSTABLE DESK: Vari motorized standing desks make it easy to transition from sitting to standing throughout the day. Research shows that standing or moving more at work can improve productivity, boost your metabolism, and reduce back pain. Our easy-to-assemble and even easier-to-use sit-stand desks can help you get more done and feel better doing it. EASY TO ASSEMBLE: With easy-to-follow instructions and all parts clearly labeled, our adjustable electric desk can be assembled quickly and easily. PLEASE NOTE: The desktop and legs are shipped in 2 boxes which may be delivered separately. Vari Essential Electric Desks are not compatible with the Vari Cable Management Tray. TRUSTED BRAND: Designed and certified to the highest industry standards, Vari's office furniture products are built-to-last for years. We back our award-winning electric standing desks with a solid 3-year warranty that replaces the full product, not just parts and pieces. With 30-Day Free Returns, we ensure a quality, risk-free purchase you can feel good about.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wm5i6tFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vari","source_asin":"B0BP9H19GQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP9H19GQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP9H19GQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
