window.products.push({"id":1054763,"name":"Gel Fiber Pillows 2 Pack – Queen Size Cotton Rich Dobby Pillow Filled with Hypoallergenic, Soft and Fluffy .4 Microdenier True Down Alternative (Soft)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+k3EHFitL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are these the right pillows for me? We create these pillows to provide an unbeatable value and an exceptional level of quality . If you are looking for an affordable, well made, machine washable, soft and fluffy pillow with plenty of support that is crafted with pride in the USA, then we suggest you try these pillows right away. If for any reason it turns out that these pillows don’t suit your personal taste, don’t worry…simply return them for a full refund, no questions asked. How does this pillow differ from the competition? These pillows are comprised of imported premium 51% Cotton / 49% Poly Dobby Fabric and top grade .4 Micro Denier Gel Fiber Poly Fill. These high end materials are expertly sewn, stuffed, packaged, and inspected in our USA based factories. The end result is a super comfortable, great quality pillow at a very affordable price. Why should I buy this Pillow 2-pack today? You will immediately notice that the Dobby Fabric on these pillows has a very high quality feel which is further accentuated by the regal looking Corded Trim. The Premium Gel Fiber fill is very soft and feels very similar to the most expensive down only with better loft retention and support while still remaining super soft and comfy. Once inside your favorite pillow case, we believe you will find that these pillows provide the same (or better) level of comfort and support as those that you would find at an expensive hotel or luxury bedding shop. Add this 2 Pillow Value Pack to your cart now while supplies last ! If you don’t get a great night sleep and don’t think this is a really great deal, simply return the pillows for your money back - no risk, no hassles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+k3EHFitL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dream Big Pillows","source_asin":"B072WB4TRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072WB4TRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072WB4TRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
