window.products.push({"id":1054786,"name":"Student Dormitory Alarm Clock, Retro Metal Decorative Clock for Bedroom, Non Ticking Small Clock with Night Light, Battery Operated, Digital Dial,Desk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713Ag2XFLfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Student Dormitory Alarm Clock, Retro Metal Decorative Clock for Bedroom, Non Ticking Small Clock with Night Light, Battery Operated, Digital Dial, Mini Clock   Product specifications Color： Green Function：Alarm Clock/Night Light Material：metal paint shell, glass mask and plastic back plate Product size： 3.5*2.5*4.3 inches Weight：8 ounces Powered by：1x AA Zinc-Carbon Battery (not included) Application：Living Room, Bedroom, Kitchen, Clinic, Office, Travel, etc Package includes：1 * Alarm Clock，1*instruction   HOW TO USE 1.Install the battery: Open the battery cover, insert an \"AA\" alkaline battery in the +/- polarity direction, and close the battery cover. 2.Adjust the clock: turn the button clockwise to the desired time. 3.Set the alarm: Turn the alarm button, rotate the pointer to the required time, and then turn on the alarm switch. 4.Night light : just goes on when you push and hold button, if you don't hold it goes off.   Note: 1.It is best to use 1 AA zinc-carbon battery (alkaline or rechargeable batteries can affect the life of the movement and the accuracy of the clock). 2.There is a slight difference between the picture and the actual item caused by the brightness of the light. 3.If the alarm clock runs slowly or if it is no longer loud enough, replace the battery in good time. 4.Keep it clean and tidy, you can wipe it gently with a soft cloth or neutral detergent. 5.Keep away from a damp environment, large magnetic fields (e.g. the devices such as refrigerators, microwave ovens, etc.) in order to avoid the effects of the magnetic field due to driving disturbances. 6.If you are not going to use the device for a long period of time, remove the battery to prevent the battery from leaking and damaging the alarm clock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713Ag2XFLfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ledisi","source_asin":"B09FQFR3NW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FQFR3NW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FQFR3NW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
