window.products.push({"id":1054822,"name":"Junhomedec 5x7 Inch Pressed Flower Frames Black Metal Double Layer Photo Frame with Dried Flowers Gift box set include Picture Frames purple Dried Flo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713c9hc-+jL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Value for money: each photo frame is carefully packed in a cardboard gift box to ensure that it is protected and intact during transportation. It contains an acrylic metal photo frame, a bag of vacuum packaged dry embossing, a pair of tweezers and a microfiber towel. Tweezers can be use in DIY pressed flowers frames, The towel can be used to wipe the acrylic glass surface to keep the acrylic clear and transparent. Safely and Lightly: Our photo frames are made of high-quality acrylic plexiglass.they are light and high-definition, not easy to break and have excellent crack resistance. When they fall to the ground, you don't have to worry about hurting children, so you can rest assured to put the photo frames in the room anyplace. The acrylic surface is pasted with a protective film to prevent the photo frame from scratching during transportation. Remember to tear off the protective film before use. Easy to use：The metal picture frame is fixed with Silicone plug, which is convenient and safe to use.You just need to use the attached tweezers to remove the silicone plug, and then use the attached dried flowers to make DIY pressed flower photo frame you want. Or replace it with other thin and flat objects, such as bookmarks, photos, images, small works of art, cards, paintings, handicrafts, souvenirs or other dry plant specimens. Multifunctional decoration: The Metal picture frame looks bright and tasteful, which complements any decoration. It is suitable for living room decoration, room decoration, girl room decoration, office decoration and classroom decoration. It is a great gift for mother's day, birthday, teacher's day, Christmas and other festivals。 It is so meaningful to display your cherished memories. Fashionable and Elegant: The photo frame is made of strong and stainless steel. it is very shiny after polishing and looks high-grade and elegant. The photo frame floats your photo between two clear acrylic Plexiglas to create an impressive and eye-catching display effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713c9hc-+jL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Junhomedec","source_asin":"B09TKKB6GH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKKB6GH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKKB6GH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
