window.products.push({"id":1054957,"name":"Magnetic Poster Hanger Frame (Natural Wood 18?- 45.72 cm) Any Vertical Length - Wood Poster Hanger for Poster, Scratch off Map Frame, Picture, Canvas,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RIn3Qsc-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAGNETIC POSTER HANGER FRAME Here’s the chance to shape your ambience in your own terms. YOU WILL RECEIVE: 1 Wood Poster Hanger SET: 4 magnetised wooden bars, 1 string for hanging installed, 2 extra strings and a storage tube, making the frame a great present (Artworks not included). DIMENSIONS: Wide compatibility and suitable for any vertical length and for non-standard sizes Single bar’s size: 18” x 0.71” x 0.27” (approx. 45.72 cm x 1.8 cm x 0.7 cm) Paper tube: 1.77” diam. x 19.09\" length. COLOUR: Wood MAX LOAD: Successfully tested to hang up to 1 lb (approx. 450 gr) TEAK WOOD , making our frame very resistant, not subject to warping or raising grain, for an outstanding quality and look. It is accurately polished for a soft touch without sharp edges or splinters. STRONG MAGNETS (3 pairs top and bottom frame) for a strong hold up to 1 lb, firmly glued into the magnetic hanging frame exactly matching for a perfect line up. (The thickness of the Poster/Canvas may affect magnets). THIN FELT lining the inside of the bars without reducing the magnets' strength but ensuring to avoid any mark or damage on your item. A magnetic poster frame without lining could cause marks and damages on the clamped item. 3 TYPES of STRINGS for HANGING , one installed and 2 extra strings. USE & BENEFITS. The neat-looking design of our poster hangers for walls, will give you the chance to display your items in a gallery style or clustering them in a unique mix, displaying both the front and back of your piece of art with the ease of change your display whenever you want a fresh look. The lightweight of our wooden poster hangers will help when moving or storing them. EASY, FAST, DIY, TOOLS-FREE INSTALLATION for our Magnetic Hanger Frame thanks to the Poster Hanging Kit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RIn3Qsc-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"oncloudnine2016","source_asin":"B07S2SQNR7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S2SQNR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S2SQNR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1054958,"name":"COSTWAY Stand Mixer, 6-Speed Tilt-Head Stand Mixer, 500W, Kitchen Electric Mixer with Dough Hook, Beater, Whisk, 5.3 Quart Stainless Steel Mixing Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vH3y959NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Powerful Motor & 6-speed Adjustment:】Coming with the 500W powerful motor, the stand mixer is certain to leave an impressive performance. Strong motor makes it a more efficient and faster way to mix food with less noise, which keeps the original taste and smoothness of food. Additionally, 6 different speeds are available, perfect for varieties of recipes and ingredients. ✅【5.3Qt Stainless Steel Bowl with Splash Guard:】The stand mixer is specially equipped with a 5.3 Qt stainless steel bowl. The large capacity allows you to conveniently mix food with adding ingredients, which perfectly meets your kitchen needs. Considering that food may be ejected, the bowl is built with a splash guard to avoid making a mess. ✅【Multiple Attachments for Versatile Use:】3 different attachments allow you to do all types of food mixing and perfectly deal with a variety of ingredients. Dough hook is designed for heavy dough, bread dough, etc. Beater is perfect for medium to light dough and batter for cakes. The whisk is capable of whipping cream, beating egg whites, etc. ✅【Tilt-Head Design & Non-slipping Pads:】 Featuring tilt-head design, the stand mixer makes it easy to install mixing bowl and attachments by pressing the unlock lever. Thanks to that, it’s also of great convenience to add ingredients. Four non-slipping pads on the bottom add extra stability and safety, which serves to keep the mixer steady while mixing food. ✅【Easy to Operate & Clean:】 The stand mixer comes with easy operation. Adjusting the button, you can freely choose the ideal speed. After pressing the lock lever, the drive can be easily swung up and lowered down. Besides, the bowl made of stainless steel is easy to clean and maintain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vH3y959NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B08QVH8RW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1054958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QVH8RW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QVH8RW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
